'''Marine Ministry''' (マリン官邸, ''Marin Kantei'', '''Marine Minister Residence''') is the 19th sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 68th sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 9.0 Update|version 9.0]], and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Like [[Coup de Chat]], all the stages are gimmick stages except for [[Triton's Cave|the third]], which may pose a threat to some. However, this sub-chapter is still one of the easiest in Uncanny Legends if not the easiest.
{{LegendDiff|140|180|100}}

